        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeremia na Hanania omobani bw’oborimo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekaba ase omwaka oyio, ekero Zedekia achagete kogamba, ase omotienyi o gatano bw’omwaka o kane, omobani korwa omochie o Gibeoni, Hanania, mosinto bw’Asuri, agakwana nainche ime ase enyomba y’Omonene. Ekero abakuani na abanto bonsi baigwete, aganteebia ng’a,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aya nar’Omonene bw’Emeganda, Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli, atebiire: “Nabunire rikorogoto ri’omorwoti o Babiloni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero emiaka ebere etaraera ning’iranie gocha aase aiga ebikorero bionsi bi’enyomba y’Omonene, ebio Nebukadinesaro, omorwoti o Babiloni, arusetie aiga, akabiira Babiloni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boigo ning’iranie Yekonia mosinto o Yehoyakimu, omorwoti bw’Abayuda, amo nabaanto bonsi bairetwe Babiloni ase obosomba korwa ase ense y’Abayuda, ekiagera nimbune rikorogoto ri’omorwoti o Babiloni.” Nab’Omonene atebiire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.28.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Yeremia omobani akairaneria Hanania omobani, agwo ase amasio ’abakuani na ase abanto bonsi bateneine ime ase enyomba y’Omonene,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akamoteebia, “Amina. Tiga Omonene akore ayio. Ee, tiga akore amang’ana ayio kwabanire aikerane, erio airanie korwa Babiloni ebikorero bi’enyomba y’Omonene na abanto bairetwe obosomba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende tegerera oigwe amang’ana aya ngokwana naye aiga ekero abanto bonsi baigwete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaabani abwo bagotang’anerete aye na inche ase chingaki chia kare nigo baabaanete igoro y’esegi, na enchara, na oborwaire bogoita, ng’a mbichiche ase chinse chinyinge na ase amarwoti are ne chinguru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende igoro ase omobani okobana ng’a omorembe nobe, amang’ana ’omobani oyio karaikeranigwe rirorio oyio nomonyakeene, naende namanyekanete ng’a ekeene Omonene nere omotomete.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.28.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Hanania, omobani oria, akarusia rikorogoto riria korwa ase rigoti ria Yeremia omobani, akaribuna.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanania agakwana ase abanto bategererete, agateeba: “Aya nar’Omonene agoteeba: Emiaka ebere etaraika nabo ndabune rikorogoto ria Nebukadinesaro, omorwoti o Babiloni, rirue ase amagoti ’ebisaku bionsi.” Korende Yeremia omobani akarua agwo, akagenda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.28.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Engaki ende, magega Hanania omobani karusirie rikorogoto riria ase rigoti ria Yeremia omobani na koribuna, ring’ana ri’Omonene rigacha ase Yeremia, rikamoteebia,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Genda oteebie Hanania ng’a inche Omonene nigo ngoteeba iga: Aye nkwabuna rikorogoto ri’omote, korende ribaga ri’Omonene naroisie eri’ekioma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya naro Nyasae bw’Emeganda agoteeba nimbeke ase amagoti ’abaanto b’ebisaku bionsi rikorogoto ri’ekioma, erinde babe abasomba ba Nebukadinesaro, omorwoti o Babiloni, nabarabwo mbamokorere, ekiagera inche Omonene namoeire ching’iti chionsi chi’orosana boigo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.28.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Yeremia omobani agateebia Hanania omobani, “Aye Hanania, tegerera oigwe, Omonene tagotometi aye, korende kwaeire abanto ribaga begene oborimo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase engencho eyi’Omonene oteebire ng’a nagoite orue ase ense. Nokwe ase omwaka oyo, ekiagera gwakwanire amang’ana agerire abanto basaririe ase Omonene.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.28.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase omotienyi o gatano na kabere ase omwaka oria Hanania omobani agakwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.28.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
